  "body": "Welcome to 116 Whangaparaoa Road, an elevated, private retreat beautifully tucked away off the main road. This single level recently refreshed, warm, and inviting 3-bedroom home is ready for you to enjoy today, with endless future possibilities, perfect for families and downsizers looking to retire in the coast with a beautiful backyard for the family to spread out and grow, and the Hibiscus Coast Community Health Centre just a few doors down for easy access to healthcare services.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a spacious open-plan living and dining area highlighted by stunning high vaulted wooden ceilings. Relax in year-round comfort with underfloor insulation, a cozy wood burner, and a heat pump. The modern kitchen flows seamlessly into the living spaces, which open directly onto a large outdoor deck - perfect for entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe 3 bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned at the back of the home to enjoy privacy and sun, with the master bedroom opening directly onto the deck. Everyday convenience is covered with a functional family bathroom featuring a shower and a bath, a separate toilet, and a large laundry room. \r\n\r\nOutside, the 809sqm near-flat section is an absolute dream. Fully fenced and safe for children and pets, the grounds feature mature fruit tree, an expansive deck and space for a vegetable patch and a playhouse! An oversized double garage provides abundant space for cars, extra storage, and a workbench, complemented by plenty of off-street parking.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------\r\nLocation & Lifestyle\r\n---------------------------------------\r\nPerfectly positioned for families, you are less than 1km from the highly regarded Red Beach School. You are just minutes away from healthcare, local Red Beach shops, the Silverdale Centre, and beautiful local beaches, parks, and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------\r\nTransport & Connectivity\r\n---------------------------------------\r\nCommuting is incredibly easy with a bus stop located nearby and convenient access to the motorway.\r\n\r\n\r\nALL CONJUNCTIONALS WELCOME, so agents, bring your buyers! \r\n\r\nContact Ian 0211592078 today to find out more!",
